OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry morning with some limited
OL,6,Fbrighter spells breaking through.
OL,7,FCloud thickening to bring some patchy
OL,8,Frain early to mid-afternoon, as
OL,9,Fsoutherly winds strengthen, with rain
OL,10,Fturning heavier and more persistent
OL,11,Flate afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FOvercast with persistent
OL,14,Flight to moderate rain through the
OL,15,Fevening, clearing to showers and clear
OL,16,Fspells during the early hours of
OL,17,FFriday morning. Fresh to strong south
OL,18,Fto southwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
