OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA day of showers mixed with
OL,6,Fbrighter spells. Showers quite
OL,7,Ffrequent for the morning, before
OL,8,Ftending to easing for the afternoon.
OL,9,FFresh to strong south to southwest
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,13,FSaturday brings showers, perhaps
OL,14,Fthundery for the morning. Showers or
OL,15,Flonger periods of rain for Sunday,
OL,16,Fcoupled with strong southerly winds.
OL,17,FMonday mainly dry with brighter spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
